# Atlas · full intellectual-history redesign

**Current candidate: v3-sourced, 30 desks / 260 combinations.** It is a complete isolated content candidate, not yet integrated or published. The original Atlas is unchanged. Independent audit covered every v1 recipe and connection, then the exact v3 semantic delta; bounded recipe-blind model readers covered two v2 slices. Their findings informed one bounded repair. Final audit closure is recorded in the handoff artifacts; no human enjoyment claim is made.

